WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.543
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.813 --> 00:11.753
I finally realised what is truly important.

3
00:13.723 --> 00:15.753
And what is truly precious.

4
00:17.853 --> 00:18.863
What is it?

5
00:21.693 --> 00:25.803
Not obsessing over what I cannot have for too long.

6
00:28.433 --> 00:31.543
Not missing out on the happiness right in front of me.

7
00:36.243 --> 00:37.973
After you...

8
00:38.043 --> 00:40.283
completely disappeared from my sight,

9
00:40.283 --> 00:41.283
I realised it.

10
00:46.683 --> 00:48.623
So please don't leave anymore.

11
00:51.493 --> 00:52.793
Just stay by my side.

12
00:57.733 --> 00:58.933
You will do that, right?

13
01:02.703 --> 01:03.703
Right?

14
01:38.073 --> 01:39.143
(Final Episode)

15
01:39.203 --> 01:40.273
Won Ho.

16
01:43.043 --> 01:44.213
Won Ho.

17
01:59.263 --> 02:01.023
(To Mi Young.)

18
02:05.503 --> 02:06.503
To Mi Young.

19
02:07.803 --> 02:08.903
Mi Young,

20
02:09.573 --> 02:11.843
I do not know how long it has been since I called your name...

21
02:11.843 --> 02:13.473
through a letter like this.

22
02:15.873 --> 02:18.943
This will probably be the last letter I write to you.

23
02:22.583 --> 02:23.683
I am sorry, Mi Young.

24
02:24.883 --> 02:29.293
I wanted to make you the happiest woman in the world.

25
02:29.323 --> 02:31.423
But I could not. I am sorry.

26
02:32.823 --> 02:34.363
I am sorry for making you lonely.

27
02:35.593 --> 02:37.363
I am sorry for hurting you.

28
02:41.303 --> 02:44.373
When you said Dallae went wrong because of the medicine...

29
02:44.433 --> 02:48.203
Will that bring our dead Dallae back to life?

30
02:48.273 --> 02:51.573
- Get out. I said get out. - Do not worry, I am leaving.

31
02:56.353 --> 02:59.023
I should have listened to you more closely back then.

32
03:02.123 --> 03:05.793
It turns out Kyung Tae tampered with the medicine on purpose.

33
03:08.733 --> 03:09.893
Kyung Tae told me.

34
03:11.703 --> 03:13.933
He was afraid I would leave him.

35
03:15.933 --> 03:17.433
That is why he did such a terrible thing...

36
03:19.043 --> 03:21.143
to our Dallae and to you.

37
03:22.943 --> 03:25.313
I thought I knew Kyung Tae well all this time.

38
03:25.383 --> 03:27.943
Why did you do that to Mi Young? Tell me.

39
03:28.013 --> 03:31.083
- I'm such an idiot. - I cannot even blame Kyung Tae.

40
03:33.083 --> 03:34.083
Everything...

41
03:35.123 --> 03:36.953
Everything is all my fault.

42
03:40.363 --> 03:42.193
Even though we are ending like this,

43
03:44.133 --> 03:48.503
I want to make sure the rest of your life is a happy ending.

44
03:53.703 --> 03:54.803
Lastly, Mi Young.

45
03:56.873 --> 03:59.543
- Won Ho! - Thank you for everything.

46
04:00.783 --> 04:03.053
I love you, Mi Young.

47
04:32.543 --> 04:33.713
Won Ho!

48
04:36.453 --> 04:37.453
Won Ho.

49
04:38.853 --> 04:40.083
Wait!

50
04:42.123 --> 04:43.153
Won Ho.

51
04:45.663 --> 04:48.433
Won Ho, wait.

52
04:55.433 --> 04:57.003
Won Ho!

53
04:57.073 --> 05:00.573
Won Ho, wait. Just wait a second. Don't go.

54
05:00.643 --> 05:02.473
Won Ho, don't go.

55
05:10.213 --> 05:14.123
Won Ho, I cannot go any further.

56
05:15.523 --> 05:17.053
Right, don't come, Mi Young.

57
05:18.423 --> 05:20.323
Do not...

58
05:20.323 --> 05:21.833
follow me anymore.

59
05:23.233 --> 05:24.593
Won Ho.

60
05:26.433 --> 05:28.303
You saw what I wrote in the letter, right?

61
05:31.433 --> 05:32.443
I am sorry!

62
05:33.643 --> 05:34.673
I am really...

63
05:36.643 --> 05:38.913
I am so truly sorry, Mi Young.

64
05:38.983 --> 05:42.053
No, that's...

65
05:42.113 --> 05:44.583
That's not your fault, Won Ho.

66
05:44.953 --> 05:47.583
No. It is all my fault.

67
05:48.593 --> 05:50.293
I will be guilty toward you...

68
05:51.923 --> 05:53.363
for the rest of my life.

69
05:56.633 --> 05:57.693
Mi Young, I think...

70
06:00.563 --> 06:02.403
it is really time now.

71
06:03.403 --> 06:04.473
Won Ho...

72
06:06.103 --> 06:07.103
Let's...

73
06:09.343 --> 06:11.043
Let's get a divorce!

74
06:14.583 --> 06:18.083
You will understand how I feel, right?

75
06:18.483 --> 06:19.783
No!

76
06:20.383 --> 06:22.593
No, I don't understand!

77
06:28.023 --> 06:29.063
But...

78
06:31.333 --> 06:32.903
if that's what you want...

79
06:35.573 --> 06:36.573
Fine.

80
06:38.173 --> 06:39.203
Let's get divorced.

81
06:43.613 --> 06:44.613
Okay.

82
06:46.183 --> 06:47.743
Let's...

83
06:47.813 --> 06:49.613
Fine, let's get divorced!

84
06:57.693 --> 07:01.793
What was the meaning of the tears we shed back then?

85
07:03.463 --> 07:07.333
Was it regret for the days we misunderstood and hurt each other?

86
07:08.603 --> 07:10.333
Were we holding on to things...

87
07:12.273 --> 07:13.543
that were already gone?

88
07:16.073 --> 07:18.843
- Do you even know? - Gosh, Mi Young.

89
07:18.913 --> 07:23.213
Don't wear pants like that. You have a hole in your knee, jerk!

90
07:23.283 --> 07:26.623
Then what am I supposed to do? I'm so furious that you tricked me,

91
07:26.683 --> 07:28.523
I can't do the broadcast or anything else.

92
07:28.593 --> 07:30.693
What am I supposed to do?

93
07:30.753 --> 07:34.193
If only we had been a little kinder to each other...

94
07:39.403 --> 07:40.403
I...

95
07:41.733 --> 07:43.473
took the medicine my husband gave me...

96
07:44.903 --> 07:46.303
and lost my baby.

97
07:46.443 --> 07:47.873
If only we had been...

98
07:48.943 --> 07:50.843
a little more honest with each other...

99
07:52.983 --> 07:54.713
If either of us...

100
07:54.783 --> 07:58.383
had the courage to take the first step toward the other...

101
08:00.153 --> 08:02.823
Would our reality be different now?

102
08:15.833 --> 08:17.773
There's no way to know.

103
08:17.873 --> 08:20.873
What is certain is that we can never...

104
08:22.413 --> 08:24.673
go back to the past.

105
08:25.683 --> 08:27.043
(Yeonnam Family Court)

106
08:29.513 --> 08:32.623
And today, we are...

107
08:35.223 --> 08:36.293
getting a divorce.

108
08:45.503 --> 08:47.233
Mi Young.

109
08:47.303 --> 08:50.173
Did you talk about anything else with your husband?

110
08:51.573 --> 08:52.573
No.

111
08:55.943 --> 08:58.473
Then why does he look so serious?

112
08:58.543 --> 08:59.543
It's making me nervous.

113
09:02.783 --> 09:05.983
Anyway, let's not let our guard down until the very end.

114
09:09.593 --> 09:10.893
Mi Young?

115
09:10.953 --> 09:13.693
Yes? Oh, right.

116
09:13.763 --> 09:17.133
Have you made up your mind?

117
09:17.233 --> 09:19.833
- What? - I said hurry up and decide.

118
09:20.363 --> 09:22.033
What we're going to eat after the trial.

119
09:22.103 --> 09:25.073
We need to decide these things in advance to save time.

120
09:25.133 --> 09:28.273
- You can decide that yourself. - Oh, come on.

121
09:29.413 --> 09:30.413
All right, then.

122
09:36.313 --> 09:38.553
(Jihwaja Motel)

123
09:43.653 --> 09:44.653
Mom.

124
09:44.723 --> 09:47.263
Did you see the new spicy webfoot octopus place next to the market?

125
09:47.323 --> 09:49.133
I hope they don't go out of business and last a long time this time.

126
09:51.363 --> 09:52.733
Mom!

127
09:53.103 --> 09:55.703
- Yes. - What are you thinking about?

128
09:56.803 --> 09:59.443
Won Ho went to court today.

129
09:59.503 --> 10:00.873
Oh, right.

130
10:01.173 --> 10:02.973
Oh, that's today.

131
10:03.043 --> 10:04.943
Did Won Ho call?

132
10:05.013 --> 10:06.383
No.

133
10:06.683 --> 10:09.853
Don't worry too much, Mom. Won Ho and my sister-in-law...

134
10:11.113 --> 10:13.623
Oh, I guess I shouldn't call her my sister-in-law anymore.

135
10:13.683 --> 10:16.153
Anyway, what worse could happen now?

136
10:16.253 --> 10:18.253
Do you remember?

137
10:18.323 --> 10:20.523
When you and your ex split up,

138
10:20.593 --> 10:22.863
you told me not to worry.

139
10:22.933 --> 10:25.863
And then you let your ex take Ha Neul away completely...

140
10:25.933 --> 10:27.933
and came back empty-handed.

141
10:28.003 --> 10:30.073
Did I do that?

142
10:30.133 --> 10:32.973
But I got Ha Neul back anyway. So it's fine.

143
10:33.073 --> 10:34.703
You call that getting him back?

144
10:34.773 --> 10:38.413
Ha Neul's mom was just too busy, so she had to give him back.

145
10:38.473 --> 10:39.483
Right.

146
10:41.043 --> 10:43.113
Do you always have to say it like that?

147
10:43.183 --> 10:44.613
Is Ha Neul some kind of object?

148
10:44.683 --> 10:49.323
I had a bad dream last night, and I am feeling really anxious.

149
10:49.993 --> 10:52.923
I feel like Won Ho is going to cause some kind of trouble.

150
10:59.103 --> 11:00.463
We cannot agree to that.

151
11:04.233 --> 11:07.943
The plaintiff is demanding a property division amount...

152
11:08.003 --> 11:10.643
on the condition of giving up the management of the company,

153
11:12.143 --> 11:13.583
but we cannot accept it.

154
11:13.643 --> 11:17.813
The plaintiff's requested amount is 790,000 dollars in total.

155
11:17.883 --> 11:22.023
We cannot accept this amount.

156
11:22.793 --> 11:24.493
What do you mean you cannot accept it?

157
11:25.123 --> 11:28.463
Did you properly review the contents of the complaint we sent?

158
11:28.523 --> 11:31.733
Of course. I read it over and over,

159
11:31.793 --> 11:33.763
and I read it again this morning.

160
11:33.833 --> 11:35.363
Then you must be well aware...

161
11:35.363 --> 11:37.803
that the plaintiff acted as the actual owner,

162
11:37.873 --> 11:39.273
must you not?

163
11:40.743 --> 11:41.743
I see.

164
11:45.443 --> 11:46.813
Mediator.

165
11:46.883 --> 11:49.753
Throughout their marriage, the plaintiff...

166
11:49.813 --> 11:52.883
supported the defendant with absolute devotion.

167
11:53.453 --> 11:54.883
By serving as co-CEO...

168
11:54.953 --> 11:56.823
of the company under the defendant's name,

169
11:56.893 --> 11:59.163
she turned an unknown startup...

170
11:59.223 --> 12:02.533
into an influential wedding shop in just three years...

171
12:02.593 --> 12:04.793
This was all possible because of the plaintiff's...

172
12:04.863 --> 12:07.103
blood, sweat, and tears.

173
12:07.163 --> 12:10.433
On the other hand, the defendant left everything...

174
12:10.503 --> 12:14.843
other than making dresses entirely up to the plaintiff.

175
12:16.143 --> 12:18.243
The company grew this much...

176
12:18.313 --> 12:22.853
- all to the plaintiff's efforts? - That is correct!

177
12:22.913 --> 12:24.853
If the plaintiff and the defendant divorce,

178
12:24.913 --> 12:27.953
the plaintiff will naturally have to leave the company,

179
12:28.023 --> 12:29.453
so she is asking for her contributions to the company...

180
12:29.523 --> 12:33.263
to be recognised in the property division.

181
12:33.323 --> 12:34.623
What exactly is the problem?

182
12:34.693 --> 12:38.193
- This is completely absurd. - How dare she...

183
12:38.263 --> 12:39.403
I think...

184
12:39.463 --> 12:41.563
you just spoke informally.

185
12:42.573 --> 12:45.773
- You heard that, right, Mediator? - Please calm down.

186
12:45.843 --> 12:47.873
Yes, well... Why you...

187
12:49.243 --> 12:50.243
Defendant,

188
12:50.313 --> 12:53.713
- do you deny the claims? - No.

189
12:54.213 --> 12:55.283
I acknowledge them.

190
12:56.313 --> 12:58.483
The plaintiff's contributions to the company...

191
12:58.553 --> 13:02.293
must be acknowledged. No, it is actually more than that.

192
13:03.353 --> 13:06.393
In fact, without the plaintiff, this company...

193
13:06.463 --> 13:09.363
would have gone bankrupt a long time ago.

194
13:10.033 --> 13:11.393
What?

195
13:11.463 --> 13:14.133
Defendant, what exactly are you trying to say?

196
13:15.363 --> 13:16.603
Yes.

197
13:16.673 --> 13:20.203
Then I will clarify everything right now.

198
13:20.573 --> 13:22.243
We...

199
13:22.313 --> 13:24.043
highly acknowledge the plaintiff's devotion...

200
13:24.113 --> 13:26.883
to the defendant and the company during their marriage,

201
13:26.943 --> 13:29.383
and therefore,

202
13:30.513 --> 13:33.623
we believe the property division of 790,000 dollars...

203
13:33.683 --> 13:36.323
is actually too small.

204
13:36.793 --> 13:38.653
Therefore, on the condition that the plaintiff...

205
13:38.723 --> 13:41.293
takes over the management of the company...

206
13:41.363 --> 13:44.963
instead of giving it up,

207
13:45.033 --> 13:47.663
we will accept the property division of 790,000 dollars...

208
13:47.733 --> 13:48.933
to be given to her.

209
13:57.473 --> 13:58.773
Here.

210
13:59.413 --> 14:00.513
Won Ho.

211
14:02.783 --> 14:04.113
What is wrong with him?

212
14:04.183 --> 14:05.923
Did he take out a loan with company money?

213
14:08.053 --> 14:10.993
No, the corporate registry is clean.

214
14:11.053 --> 14:12.393
Plaintiff.

215
14:12.493 --> 14:14.493
In the claims the plaintiff made against the defendant,

216
14:14.563 --> 14:16.933
the management rights were not specified,

217
14:17.733 --> 14:20.503
but if you accept the defendant's proposal here right now,

218
14:20.563 --> 14:22.333
a voluntary mediation is possible.

219
14:22.403 --> 14:24.373
Will you accept the defendant's proposal?

220
14:26.043 --> 14:28.103
Mi Young, just accept it for now.

221
14:29.913 --> 14:31.743
Is it not a good thing to get the management rights?

222
14:45.993 --> 14:46.993
No.

223
14:48.593 --> 14:50.263
I cannot accept the management rights.

224
14:54.333 --> 14:55.773
Are you serious, Mi Young?

225
14:57.033 --> 14:58.273
Yes, Lawyer Jeon.

226
14:58.933 --> 15:00.573
It is the management rights, of all things.

227
15:02.773 --> 15:04.013
My client says...

228
15:04.643 --> 15:06.443
she will not accept the management rights.

229
15:08.043 --> 15:11.383
Please only negotiate regarding the property division.

230
15:11.453 --> 15:14.323
- Defendant, did you hear that? - Yes.

231
15:14.823 --> 15:18.453
As the plaintiff's counsel mentioned earlier,

232
15:18.523 --> 15:22.063
the plaintiff is the actual owner of the company...

233
15:22.123 --> 15:25.363
and is responsible for most of the management duties.

234
15:25.433 --> 15:26.603
That's not all.

235
15:27.203 --> 15:28.333
Not only with household chores,

236
15:28.403 --> 15:32.303
but also taking care of all the in-laws' affairs,

237
15:32.373 --> 15:34.673
the plaintiff, as a spouse, has truly...

238
15:34.743 --> 15:38.013
played a near-perfect role.

239
15:39.783 --> 15:41.913
Therefore, our defendant...

240
15:41.983 --> 15:44.353
wishes to generously repay...

241
15:44.413 --> 15:48.223
the plaintiff for her past dedication...

242
15:48.283 --> 15:50.853
and believes that she should naturally take...

243
15:50.923 --> 15:54.093
not only the property division...

244
15:54.163 --> 15:57.733
but also the company's management rights.

245
16:03.803 --> 16:04.973
I said she is not accepting them.

246
16:05.033 --> 16:07.373
Stop refusing and just take them when offered.

247
16:07.443 --> 16:09.813
Opportunities like this are not common.

248
16:15.853 --> 16:17.513
As I have said,

249
16:18.153 --> 16:19.553
our plaintiff...

250
16:19.623 --> 16:23.693
- will not accept management rights. - Then...

251
16:24.293 --> 16:26.163
are you going to give up the property division too?

252
16:26.223 --> 16:28.763
Are you saying that if we do not accept the management rights,

253
16:28.823 --> 16:30.993
you will not agree to the property division either?

254
16:31.063 --> 16:33.003
Did I not mention that at the beginning?

255
16:33.063 --> 16:34.503
If you give up the management rights,

256
16:34.563 --> 16:36.973
we cannot accept the property division.

257
16:37.033 --> 16:38.803
I knew it.

258
16:38.873 --> 16:40.503
Tell me honestly.

259
16:40.573 --> 16:42.043
The management rights are just an excuse,

260
16:42.103 --> 16:43.213
and you have no intention of negotiating...

261
16:43.273 --> 16:44.743
the property division, do you?

262
16:44.813 --> 16:47.983
Is there perhaps a problem with the defendant's finances?

263
16:48.043 --> 16:49.383
Not at all.

264
16:49.453 --> 16:52.413
Our defendant's financial status is very solid.

265
16:54.423 --> 16:56.223
Can you prove that?

266
16:56.793 --> 16:58.253
That is difficult right now.

267
16:58.323 --> 16:59.963
- What? - I came here...

268
17:00.993 --> 17:03.463
- empty-handed today. - I have had enough of this!

269
17:03.533 --> 17:06.163
- I am really empty-handed. - Are you kidding me right now?

270
17:06.233 --> 17:08.033
Does it sound like I am kidding?

271
17:08.103 --> 17:09.333
Please be quiet, Plaintiff and Defendant.

272
17:09.403 --> 17:11.433
Defendant, do not provoke the plaintiff.

273
17:11.503 --> 17:13.243
Plaintiff's counsel, please sit down.

274
17:13.303 --> 17:14.743
Do not just stand there like that.

275
17:15.803 --> 17:18.743
- Please be quiet, Counsellor. - Lawyer Bae.

276
17:18.813 --> 17:19.813
Mi Young!

277
17:26.423 --> 17:27.883
(Yeonnam Family Court Notice Board)

278
17:27.953 --> 17:31.253
- How can you just leave like this? - What about you, Won Ho?

279
17:31.323 --> 17:33.293
What is this, all of a sudden?

280
17:33.363 --> 17:35.223
Why are you handing the management rights over to me?

281
17:35.293 --> 17:37.193
I kept thinking about it until today also.

282
17:38.733 --> 17:39.803
Wait a minute.

283
17:40.233 --> 17:41.733
But is this really something to get so angry about...

284
17:41.803 --> 17:43.473
that you would storm out like this?

285
17:43.703 --> 17:45.573
You are getting the property division you wanted,

286
17:45.633 --> 17:47.343
and you get the management rights on top of that.

287
17:47.403 --> 17:48.443
What is so bad about that?

288
17:50.773 --> 17:53.413
Yes, I am sorry for bringing it up so suddenly.

289
17:53.483 --> 17:54.483
But...

290
17:55.683 --> 17:59.053
think about it carefully. The management rights are for you.

291
17:59.113 --> 18:02.423
- You did all this just for me? - Of course.

292
18:02.483 --> 18:04.153
I did it all for you, obviously.

293
18:06.423 --> 18:09.333
You have done nothing but suffer for the seven years we were married.

294
18:09.393 --> 18:11.433
You have been through so much all this time,

295
18:11.493 --> 18:12.803
so how would a few dollars from the divorce settlement...

296
18:12.863 --> 18:14.303
be any consolation?

297
18:15.363 --> 18:16.933
You should at least have the company...

298
18:17.003 --> 18:20.643
- so you feel less wronged. - Then what is left for you?

299
18:21.073 --> 18:22.403
If you hand over the company, the only thing you'll get...

300
18:22.473 --> 18:25.843
after the divorce, what do you plan to do then?

301
18:25.913 --> 18:28.143
I am a designer, Mi Young.

302
18:28.783 --> 18:32.053
As long as I have my skills, I can make dresses anywhere.

303
18:32.353 --> 18:36.523
There is absolutely no reason why my place has to be at J&White.

304
18:38.493 --> 18:40.463
Even so, this is a bit...

305
18:40.523 --> 18:41.523
Mi Young.

306
18:42.993 --> 18:44.933
- Let us go for now. - What?

307
18:46.963 --> 18:48.703
Let us go grab something to eat too.

308
18:50.973 --> 18:54.143
- Let us go that way. - Gosh...

309
18:56.473 --> 18:58.473
They do not call him snake for nothing.

310
19:00.313 --> 19:01.313
What?

311
19:02.543 --> 19:03.753
If you do not accept the management rights,

312
19:03.813 --> 19:05.913
he will not agree to the property division?

313
19:05.983 --> 19:08.553
Who is he trying to fool? What a scam.

314
19:11.153 --> 19:12.453
Mi Young,

315
19:12.523 --> 19:14.563
I will make sure you get your share of the property no matter what,

316
19:14.623 --> 19:15.623
so do not worry about a thing.

317
19:19.193 --> 19:21.763
By the way, Mi Young, why did you do that?

318
19:22.203 --> 19:24.233
- Excuse me? - The management rights.

319
19:25.373 --> 19:27.203
Do you really hate the idea of taking them that much?

320
19:27.573 --> 19:29.173
Yes, I do.

321
19:29.243 --> 19:31.773
Why? Why do you hate it?

322
19:31.843 --> 19:34.243
J&White is not just a simple company.

323
19:34.313 --> 19:35.613
It is a brand.

324
19:35.683 --> 19:39.153
Every single dress my husband makes is J&White,

325
19:39.213 --> 19:41.053
and J&White is my husband.

326
19:42.853 --> 19:43.923
The management rights...

327
19:44.923 --> 19:46.423
must go to my husband.

328
19:48.463 --> 19:50.093
What is wrong with everyone today?

329
19:50.163 --> 19:52.093
Am I the only one who does not understand this situation?

330
19:52.163 --> 19:54.663
Or am I the weird one?

331
19:58.373 --> 20:00.473
Anyway, let us eat and gather our strength...

332
20:00.543 --> 20:02.173
so we can come up with a plan.

333
20:03.973 --> 20:05.913
That snake...

334
20:05.973 --> 20:09.383
I am going to turn him into a hagfish.

335
20:19.993 --> 20:22.833
I thought I was going to die from the cringe.

336
20:34.003 --> 20:36.073
To generously repay the plaintiff...

337
20:36.143 --> 20:39.213
for her past devotion.

338
20:40.713 --> 20:42.913
Who in the world gives away management rights like that?

339
20:45.253 --> 20:47.683
- Me. - I really...

340
20:47.753 --> 20:49.323
put on the performance of a lifetime...

341
20:49.393 --> 20:51.793
just to make you look like a good guy.

342
20:51.853 --> 20:53.193
You did a very good job.

343
20:56.333 --> 20:57.333
Right.

344
20:57.393 --> 20:59.633
Anyway, I am truly grateful for that.

345
20:59.703 --> 21:02.233
Oh, stop it.

346
21:03.273 --> 21:05.973
Even if you have no confidence in management,

347
21:06.033 --> 21:07.643
how could you just hand it all over like this?

348
21:10.513 --> 21:14.513
Think about it carefully, even now. Are you...

349
21:14.583 --> 21:16.153
absolutely sure you cannot manage it?

350
21:17.553 --> 21:19.653
No matter how much I think about it, I cannot do it.

351
21:19.723 --> 21:22.993
So you are going to hand over management rights no matter what?

352
21:24.793 --> 21:25.893
Yes.

353
21:26.393 --> 21:28.363
Until now, everything related to managing the company...

354
21:28.423 --> 21:30.563
was entirely handled by my wife.

355
21:31.063 --> 21:33.733
To be honest, I only know how to make dresses.

356
21:33.803 --> 21:36.433
I know absolutely zero about management.

357
21:36.503 --> 21:38.573
I have no talent for it and no confidence either.

358
21:38.633 --> 21:40.873
If we get divorced and my wife leaves the company,

359
21:40.943 --> 21:43.643
it will only be a matter of time before the company goes under.

360
21:43.713 --> 21:46.243
So, because you do not want to see the company fail,

361
21:46.313 --> 21:48.183
you want to hand it over quickly.

362
21:50.353 --> 21:51.783
This company is like our child.

363
21:52.853 --> 21:55.883
- One of us has to protect it. - How frustrating.

364
21:57.853 --> 22:00.063
You should have done better from the start.

365
22:02.123 --> 22:03.533
Anyway,

366
22:04.033 --> 22:07.203
persuading her will not be easy. You saw her earlier.

367
22:07.263 --> 22:08.503
As soon as management rights were mentioned,

368
22:08.563 --> 22:10.403
she stormed right out.

369
22:10.473 --> 22:13.573
Then what should we do? Is there any clever solution?

370
22:14.603 --> 22:15.643
Raise your glass.

371
22:18.413 --> 22:21.483
Just trust me and wait.

372
22:22.083 --> 22:24.483
Yes. I will trust you.

373
22:28.853 --> 22:29.853
Goodness.

374
23:20.573 --> 23:22.643
Then what is left for you?

375
23:22.643 --> 23:26.113
If you hand over the company, the only thing you'll get...

376
23:26.483 --> 23:28.183
after the divorce, what do you plan to do then?

377
23:31.453 --> 23:33.553
What is the point of a company without you?

378
23:35.983 --> 23:39.663
As long as I have my skills, I can make dresses anywhere.

379
23:39.723 --> 23:43.863
There is absolutely no reason why I have to be at J&White.

380
23:45.593 --> 23:47.833
Then why do I have to be there?

381
23:49.233 --> 23:51.033
When you are not even there?

382
24:06.113 --> 24:07.953
Wait, when did you get here?

383
24:08.423 --> 24:10.693
I was waiting until you finished watering the plants.

384
24:14.363 --> 24:16.063
Anyway, what brings you here?

385
24:16.463 --> 24:19.863
- Let us face off like pros. - Face off directly?

386
24:19.933 --> 24:21.933
Stop playing useless tricks behind my back.

387
24:22.003 --> 24:24.573
Tricks? What are you talking about?

388
24:26.303 --> 24:29.373
The divorce trial for the chairman of Yukryong Construction.

389
24:30.773 --> 24:32.013
You remember it, right?

390
24:36.583 --> 24:38.013
You should remember it.

391
24:38.083 --> 24:41.153
- It was the trial of the century. - Are rumours of an affair true?

392
24:41.223 --> 24:42.483
That trial...

393
24:43.123 --> 24:45.453
was a lawsuit that would change my life.

394
24:45.523 --> 24:46.763
Did you know from the beginning?

395
24:46.823 --> 24:50.763
Divorce trial of the century, with fortunes at stake.

396
24:50.833 --> 24:54.003
It was. I represented the plaintiff.

397
24:54.063 --> 24:57.803
And you defended the shameless defendant...

398
24:57.873 --> 25:00.443
who hid the existence of a child out of wedlock...

399
25:00.503 --> 25:04.513
- and refused to divorce. - Due to the lack of evidence...

400
25:04.573 --> 25:07.183
regarding Chairman Yuk's affair and the child out of wedlock,

401
25:07.243 --> 25:11.083
- I had practically won that trial. - Right.

402
25:11.913 --> 25:12.913
However...

403
25:15.023 --> 25:18.093
I call the defendant's driver as a witness.

404
25:18.423 --> 25:20.223
Hey, you punk.

405
25:20.393 --> 25:22.023
Is this how you repay my kindness?

406
25:23.233 --> 25:26.033
- Gosh, Chairman... - Will the child stay quiet?

407
25:27.763 --> 25:28.903
Darn it.

408
25:30.203 --> 25:33.143
And to win the trial,

409
25:33.203 --> 25:37.243
- you threw out a cowardly bait. - A cowardly bait?

410
25:37.313 --> 25:39.983
I was just faithfully following the trial procedures.

411
25:40.283 --> 25:43.553
You blindly put someone on the stand without any evidence...

412
25:43.613 --> 25:45.483
and caused the chairman to have a mental breakdown.

413
25:45.553 --> 25:47.953
If that is not bait, then what is?

414
25:48.023 --> 25:52.293
What broke the chairman down was his conscience. Not the bait.

415
25:52.693 --> 25:55.893
- What did you say? - That is the nature of conscience.

416
25:56.223 --> 26:00.433
The more you try to cover it up and hide it, the more it squirms.

417
26:00.633 --> 26:01.903
Twitching like this...

418
26:01.963 --> 26:03.273
Twitch.

419
26:03.333 --> 26:05.703
- Is it bait? Or conscience? - What?

420
26:05.773 --> 26:06.843
Management rights.

421
26:08.003 --> 26:10.043
No matter how much I think about it, it seems like bait.

422
26:11.273 --> 26:12.713
If you are that curious,

423
26:12.773 --> 26:14.143
why don't you just bite it and see?

424
26:14.213 --> 26:17.183
- Whether it is bait or not. - I cannot do that.

425
26:17.253 --> 26:19.253
I have already fallen for it once.

426
26:19.883 --> 26:21.623
All right. Anyway,

427
26:22.123 --> 26:23.323
let's do our best.

428
26:34.433 --> 26:35.603
Welcome.

429
26:35.663 --> 26:38.603
- I want a dress consultation. - Oh, right.

430
26:38.673 --> 26:39.843
I will guide you this way.

431
26:39.903 --> 26:42.343
I can consult directly with Designer Ji Won Ho, right?

432
26:43.573 --> 26:47.483
But CEO Ji is not in right now. Instead, CEO Baek...

433
26:47.543 --> 26:49.753
Never mind. I will come back next time.

434
26:50.383 --> 26:52.483
Let's go. Gosh, what a waste of time.

435
26:52.553 --> 26:53.723
Goodbye.

436
26:53.723 --> 26:56.023
I will contact you as soon as CEO Ji arrives.

437
26:56.083 --> 26:57.623
Please make sure to visit us again.

438
26:58.623 --> 27:00.063
Goodbye.

439
27:04.193 --> 27:07.963
- How many times has this been? - I know.

440
27:08.033 --> 27:10.703
Everyone is only looking for CEO Ji today.

441
27:12.733 --> 27:14.403
Why are you all standing around?

442
27:15.143 --> 27:17.573
Are the consultations for today's reserved clients already finished?

443
27:18.073 --> 27:19.073
What?

444
27:27.923 --> 27:30.353
You are being connected to voicemail...

445
27:33.093 --> 27:36.993
- Did CEO Ji take the day off? - No, not at all.

446
27:37.793 --> 27:41.103
Do you think CEO Ji might have gone off the grid?

447
27:43.303 --> 27:45.903
How many clients came looking for CEO Ji today?

448
27:45.973 --> 27:48.143
All of them.

449
27:48.443 --> 27:49.773
All of them?

450
27:49.843 --> 27:53.443
CEO Ji also has consultations scheduled for the afternoon.

451
27:54.943 --> 27:56.813
What are we going to do, seriously?

452
27:58.183 --> 28:00.723
Just one. Oh, darn.

453
28:00.783 --> 28:03.823
Just one. Come on.

454
28:03.893 --> 28:04.893
Welcome...

455
28:15.103 --> 28:16.773
He doesn't want the management rights,

456
28:16.933 --> 28:18.433
and he is not going to work.

457
28:19.473 --> 28:20.943
So that is what happened.

458
28:21.573 --> 28:22.903
No wonder.

459
28:23.343 --> 28:27.883
Seung Ho, please try to persuade Won Ho.

460
28:28.543 --> 28:30.513
Even if Won Ho does not listen to anyone else,

461
28:30.583 --> 28:32.513
he listens to you well.

462
28:32.583 --> 28:37.523
Once Won Ho makes up his mind, he does not listen to anyone.

463
28:37.593 --> 28:39.863
But I will try talking to him anyway.

464
28:39.923 --> 28:41.493
Thank you, Seung Ho.

465
28:41.963 --> 28:42.963
Mi Young.

466
28:44.633 --> 28:45.633
Are you okay?

467
28:46.193 --> 28:49.533
- Sorry? - At least Won Ho has me,

468
28:49.933 --> 28:53.033
but you do not have any siblings. I was wondering...

469
28:53.103 --> 28:54.943
who you open up to when you are having a hard time.

470
28:56.673 --> 28:58.573
Anyway, this punk, Won Ho...

471
28:58.643 --> 29:00.843
Where did he go instead of going to work?

472
29:00.913 --> 29:03.213
He is a funny guy, seriously.

473
29:03.283 --> 29:04.713
I think I know...

474
29:05.883 --> 29:07.453
where he is.

475
29:08.753 --> 29:13.193
Today, we are going to draw our favourite things.

476
29:14.263 --> 29:16.263
- Is anyone done with drawing? - I am.

477
29:16.263 --> 29:17.433
Oh, are you finished?

478
29:17.493 --> 29:20.363
- Yes. - Let me see. Let's see.

479
29:20.633 --> 29:22.333
Goodness!

480
29:22.433 --> 29:24.633
- I drew it well, right? - Are these two friends?

481
29:24.703 --> 29:27.003
Yes. This is Wenda.

482
29:27.073 --> 29:29.543
- But how should we colour... - Wenda?

483
29:29.603 --> 29:31.243
- She is silver, though? - Oh, is she?

484
29:31.313 --> 29:32.313
Let's try it anyway.

485
29:33.643 --> 29:35.813
What colour should we use? Black?

486
29:36.383 --> 29:37.483
Okay.

487
29:38.013 --> 29:39.713
What colour are you going to make Wenda?

488
29:40.953 --> 29:42.683
She is originally white.

489
29:53.603 --> 29:55.363
How did you know I was here?

490
29:55.433 --> 29:57.633
Where else would you go other than the motel?

491
29:59.133 --> 30:01.143
What are you doing here right now?

492
30:01.203 --> 30:04.043
Volunteer work. I told Father Kwon that for a while,

493
30:04.073 --> 30:06.173
I would watch the kids here.

494
30:06.683 --> 30:08.913
That darn volunteer work, seriously.

495
30:09.443 --> 30:11.553
Won Ho, you are the CEO of the company.

496
30:11.613 --> 30:13.523
For a CEO to be so irresponsible!

497
30:13.583 --> 30:15.623
Are you not embarrassed to face the employees?

498
30:15.683 --> 30:17.493
That is why I am not going to do it anymore.

499
30:17.553 --> 30:18.553
What?

500
30:20.163 --> 30:22.863
From today on, you be the CEO alone.

501
30:22.993 --> 30:25.693
- Alone? - I am handing over management.

502
30:26.263 --> 30:27.903
Starting today, I will let you do...

503
30:27.963 --> 30:29.533
the thing you do best to your heart's content.

504
30:30.803 --> 30:33.233
I will not argue or get in your way,

505
30:33.303 --> 30:35.303
so you take charge of J&White and do a good job.

506
30:35.373 --> 30:38.413
- You are really not going to argue? - Of course not.

507
30:38.743 --> 30:40.943
From now on, I will follow your opinions unconditionally.

508
30:41.443 --> 30:42.713
Understood.

509
30:43.413 --> 30:46.183
- Okay. - Then I am quitting the company.

510
30:46.753 --> 30:47.753
What?

511
30:49.183 --> 30:50.993
What if my husband...

512
30:51.053 --> 30:53.663
insists on giving me the management rights until the end?

513
30:53.723 --> 30:55.223
We have to show him too.

514
30:55.693 --> 30:57.063
If they are going to be stubborn,

515
30:57.133 --> 30:59.133
you have to be even more stubborn.

516
30:59.533 --> 31:01.103
Fight fire with fire.

517
31:01.663 --> 31:03.233
From this moment on,

518
31:03.433 --> 31:06.103
I am completely cutting ties with J&White.

519
31:06.873 --> 31:07.903
What do you mean, cutting ties?

520
31:07.973 --> 31:09.243
What are you talking about all of a sudden?

521
31:09.573 --> 31:11.273
Who will mind the company?

522
31:11.313 --> 31:13.273
If you're worried, you go and check.

523
31:15.143 --> 31:16.483
Seriously...

524
31:18.583 --> 31:21.153
In order to avoid dividing assets with the plaintiff,

525
31:21.223 --> 31:23.693
the defendant is abusing management rights of the company,

526
31:23.753 --> 31:26.253
and the grounds for this are as follows.

527
31:26.323 --> 31:28.423
What, 790,00 dollars for the asset division?

528
31:28.493 --> 31:31.033
- Is 790,000 a joke to you? - So?

529
31:31.093 --> 31:33.803
- You refuse to give it? - I cannot give it,

530
31:33.863 --> 31:35.303
so just do it by the book

531
31:35.363 --> 31:36.533
First,

532
31:36.603 --> 31:39.673
regarding the plaintiff's demands for asset division,

533
31:39.733 --> 31:41.903
the defendant has never agreed to them...

534
31:41.973 --> 31:44.443
and has instead strongly opposed them.

535
31:44.513 --> 31:46.013
Stop acting like you know everything.

536
31:46.073 --> 31:47.483
Is the company yours or something?

537
31:47.543 --> 31:49.513
- Second. - Yes.

538
31:49.583 --> 31:52.413
Due to differences in opinion regarding company matters,

539
31:52.483 --> 31:54.483
the defendant frequently clashed with the plaintiff.

540
31:56.793 --> 31:58.393
Furthermore, he always emphasized to the plaintiff...

541
31:58.453 --> 32:02.863
that the company's identity belonged to the defendant.

542
32:02.923 --> 32:05.963
Just use this. I bought some of this today.

543
32:06.033 --> 32:07.233
- Oh, my. - Here.

544
32:08.233 --> 32:11.033
- The preparatory brief has arrived. - Oh, it is here already?

545
32:12.573 --> 32:13.673
Only one page came?

546
32:15.203 --> 32:17.113
Judging from these circumstances,

547
32:17.643 --> 32:19.613
the defendant's intent to hand over management rights...

548
32:19.613 --> 32:21.183
to the plaintiff...

549
32:21.243 --> 32:24.883
cannot be seen as pure, and therefore, the plaintiff...

550
32:24.953 --> 32:27.723
cannot accept the defendant's demands.

551
32:27.783 --> 32:29.253
What do you mean, it cannot be seen as pure?

552
32:29.323 --> 32:30.653
What is this nonsense?

553
32:31.453 --> 32:33.793
You told me to just trust you!

554
32:37.163 --> 32:38.893
It is not as easy as I thought.

555
32:39.893 --> 32:41.063
Seriously.

556
32:41.603 --> 32:42.933
If this keeps up and my wife...

557
32:43.003 --> 32:45.203
refuses to take management rights, what will you do?

558
32:45.273 --> 32:48.973
Then what else can we do? We will have to force it on her.

559
32:49.043 --> 32:52.213
- What? - Wait. I knew this would happen,

560
32:52.273 --> 32:54.983
so I set a little trap.

561
32:55.743 --> 32:57.183
A trap?

562
32:57.253 --> 33:00.153
Smoke to lure the tiger out of its cave.

563
33:02.623 --> 33:06.523
It is about time for a bite.

564
33:11.963 --> 33:13.163
Yes, Manager Song.

565
33:13.703 --> 33:17.473
- Is it true? - So unlucky. We want a refund!

566
33:21.273 --> 33:22.803
Give us a refund!

567
33:22.873 --> 33:26.373
CEO Ji, where are you? Customers are here,

568
33:26.443 --> 33:28.343
and they are making a huge fuss.

569
33:28.343 --> 33:29.743
What?

570
33:29.813 --> 33:32.283
Okay, I understand. I will be right there.

571
33:32.713 --> 33:35.353
- What is happening all of a sudden? - I told you, right?

572
33:35.823 --> 33:37.223
That we would get a bite.

573
33:38.423 --> 33:40.893
What? Did you do this?

574
33:41.263 --> 33:44.793
- What on earth did you do? - I just...

575
33:45.593 --> 33:48.563
posted a promotional message on the local moms' forum.

576
33:49.103 --> 33:51.173
"Even if we are getting divorced soon,"

577
33:51.233 --> 33:55.143
"please support and show interest in J&White."

578
33:55.643 --> 33:56.873
What did you say?

579
33:56.943 --> 34:00.483
Just wait. Your wife will be at the company soon.

580
34:01.113 --> 34:06.053
I seriously cannot deal with this. Darn. See you later.

581
34:07.383 --> 34:10.353
That guy... I told him to temper his anger.

582
34:11.623 --> 34:13.893
A refund will be difficult, ma'am.

583
34:13.963 --> 34:16.933
Ma'am, cancellation as of today is not possible.

584
34:16.993 --> 34:19.263
Given that the wedding shop caters to...

585
34:19.333 --> 34:21.063
prospective couples about to get married,

586
34:21.133 --> 34:24.673
plaintiff Baek Mi Young and defendant Ji Won Ho's divorce,

587
34:24.733 --> 34:29.343
is bound to have a negative impact on the company's reputation.

588
34:29.773 --> 34:31.013
(They were a couple who were married in name only?)

589
34:31.073 --> 34:32.913
(A wedding shop couple getting divorced?)

590
34:32.973 --> 34:34.083
(I got my dress there.)

591
34:34.143 --> 34:35.683
(I'm completely ruined.)

592
34:38.653 --> 34:40.483
(How can we trust them with our wedding dresses?)

593
34:44.993 --> 34:46.053
Let me see...

594
34:50.833 --> 34:52.833
The male CEO...

595
34:52.893 --> 34:55.703
from here...

596
34:55.763 --> 34:57.073
is a total...

597
34:57.133 --> 34:58.603
huge...

598
34:58.673 --> 35:00.303
jerk.

599
35:08.213 --> 35:09.283
Furthermore,

600
35:09.343 --> 35:11.053
the plaintiff, who has operated the company...

601
35:11.113 --> 35:13.453
with outstanding management skills...

602
35:13.513 --> 35:17.023
Could she really have been unaware of the impact...

603
35:17.493 --> 35:18.953
their divorce would have on the company?

604
35:21.763 --> 35:23.263
(Song A Ri)

605
35:27.533 --> 35:28.763
Yes, A Ri.

606
35:28.833 --> 35:31.103
If the plaintiff, who treated the company like her own child...

607
35:31.173 --> 35:34.673
and dedicated herself to it,

608
35:34.743 --> 35:38.943
ignores this crisis...

609
35:39.013 --> 35:42.183
and only demands property division,

610
35:42.243 --> 35:45.113
would that not be too selfish of an action?

611
35:46.953 --> 35:48.353
Bring out the CEO!

612
35:50.323 --> 35:54.223
Like the defendant who gave up management for the plaintiff,

613
35:55.923 --> 35:58.893
we hope the plaintiff will also...

614
35:58.963 --> 36:01.363
make a decision for the sake of the company.

615
36:01.933 --> 36:04.033
For the company, the plaintiff, the defendant,

616
36:04.103 --> 36:07.573
and for the peace of everyone involved.

617
36:08.873 --> 36:11.943
How about focusing on the dresses, regardless of the divorce?

618
36:13.013 --> 36:16.043
The dresses have nothing to do with your personal lives.

619
36:16.113 --> 36:17.853
(Baek Mi Young)

620
36:18.853 --> 36:19.953
Are you the CEO?

621
36:27.093 --> 36:28.093
(Lawyer Jeon Chi Hyun)

622
36:29.063 --> 36:31.793
- Yes, Lawyer Jeon. - Mi Young, what are you doing?

623
36:31.863 --> 36:33.263
Are you enjoying your well-deserved rest?

624
36:33.963 --> 36:35.163
Yes.

625
36:35.233 --> 36:39.273
But I saw a post on the moms' forum.

626
36:39.303 --> 36:41.543
A post? What kind of post?

627
36:41.673 --> 36:44.243
It was talking about my husband and me getting a divorce.

628
36:44.313 --> 36:47.083
And because wedding shop CEOs are getting divorced,

629
36:48.283 --> 36:50.783
there were so many negative comments.

630
36:50.853 --> 36:54.623
- That is all snake's doing. - What?

631
36:54.683 --> 36:57.853
Mi Young, you absolutely must not respond, understood?

632
36:58.623 --> 37:01.593
From now on, you have nothing to do with the company.

633
37:02.023 --> 37:04.963
Oh, okay, I will keep that in mind.

634
37:13.303 --> 37:15.603
Because of the dress you made,

635
37:16.043 --> 37:18.143
my wedding was ruined,

636
37:18.543 --> 37:22.013
so you need to pay for the dress and compensate my distress.

637
37:22.083 --> 37:24.813
You say your wedding was ruined because of my dress?

638
37:24.983 --> 37:27.583
Of course it is because of you. A guy who is about to get divorced...

639
37:27.653 --> 37:30.923
- has no business making dresses. - Excuse me?

640
37:31.053 --> 37:33.763
- Are you done talking? - No, I am not. Why?

641
37:33.823 --> 37:35.863
Oh, seriously, do you think I am an idiot?

642
37:35.923 --> 37:37.993
CEO Ji, please hold back. You cannot do this.

643
37:38.733 --> 37:41.563
You better leave before I call the police.

644
37:41.863 --> 37:43.563
So you are saying you will not pay me?

645
37:43.633 --> 37:45.733
Why would I pay you? Get out right now!

646
37:50.343 --> 37:51.343
Come in.

647
37:57.283 --> 37:58.283
What is going on?

648
38:01.683 --> 38:02.683
What are you waiting for?

649
38:04.093 --> 38:05.093
- Yes, sir. - Yes, sir.

650
38:12.093 --> 38:13.093
Move!

651
38:14.903 --> 38:17.473
Who are you people? Stop this right now!

652
38:17.533 --> 38:19.033
You talk to me.

653
38:20.133 --> 38:21.143
What?

654
38:28.113 --> 38:29.113
Hurry up.

655
38:45.333 --> 38:47.833
What? It's not even 12pm.

656
39:00.713 --> 39:02.943
(Song A Ri)

657
39:06.283 --> 39:09.853
- Are you going to pay me or not? - You should be paying.

658
39:09.923 --> 39:10.923
What?

659
39:10.993 --> 39:12.993
For trashing our shop like this, I'm going to sue you...

660
39:13.053 --> 39:14.623
for all the damages. Got it?

661
39:14.693 --> 39:16.423
You still haven't come to your senses.

662
39:16.493 --> 39:17.733
Stop it, you jerks.

663
39:20.563 --> 39:22.003
- Mi Young! - Mi Young, it's dangerous.

664
39:22.003 --> 39:23.063
Get out of here.

665
39:24.833 --> 39:26.303
Darn it.

666
39:26.373 --> 39:29.903
- Who is this now? - Did you trash our shop?

667
39:29.973 --> 39:32.473
Yes, we did it. Why? What are you going to do about it?

668
39:32.543 --> 39:33.943
I might let other things slide,

669
39:34.013 --> 39:36.613
but I will not tolerate you ruining J&White like this.

670
39:36.683 --> 39:39.613
- And what if you don't tolerate it? - What am I going to do?

671
39:43.553 --> 39:45.153
What the hell?

672
39:45.223 --> 39:47.053
Hey, grab her.

673
39:47.123 --> 39:48.523
Grab her!

674
39:48.593 --> 39:50.563
- Stop it! - Darn it!

675
39:51.893 --> 39:55.833
- Darn. Have you lost your mind? - Hit me. I dare you to hit me.

676
39:55.903 --> 39:57.233
You think I won't?

677
39:57.303 --> 39:58.303
Hey!

678
40:08.143 --> 40:10.783
Have we met somewhere before?

679
40:11.213 --> 40:12.883
Why do you look so familiar?

680
40:13.383 --> 40:14.523
I know, right?

681
40:15.183 --> 40:17.323
You look familiar to me too.

682
40:18.453 --> 40:20.623
Where have we seen each other?

683
40:21.793 --> 40:25.933
Do you happen to know Bok Soon from Hwasun?

684
40:26.493 --> 40:27.703
Bok Soon?

685
40:28.763 --> 40:32.003
- Oh, Jeong Bok Soon? - Yes, that is right.

686
40:32.073 --> 40:35.403
You helped with Jeong Bok Soon's free wedding five years ago.

687
40:35.903 --> 40:39.243
I am Jeong Bok Soon's younger brother.

688
40:39.313 --> 40:41.183
- Jeong Bok Soon's brother? - Yes.

689
40:41.183 --> 40:42.583
Long time no see!

690
40:42.983 --> 40:46.053
Gosh, I mean, what are the odds?

691
40:46.213 --> 40:48.823
- I know, right? - What are you doing? Say hello.

692
40:48.883 --> 40:51.053
This is the person who, when our family was struggling,

693
40:51.123 --> 40:54.193
helped our sister's free wedding. She is our saviour.

694
40:54.263 --> 40:55.463
- Hello! - Hello!

695
40:57.193 --> 41:00.033
Oh, no need for formalities. But...

696
41:00.963 --> 41:03.133
Gosh, that is a bit of a problem.

697
41:03.203 --> 41:05.073
Oh, we are sorry.

698
41:05.133 --> 41:06.603
- We are sorry! - We are sorry!

699
41:07.033 --> 41:09.773
I did not know you were our saviour, and I was so disrespectful.

700
41:11.573 --> 41:13.013
Hey, what are you doing? Clean it up quickly.

701
41:13.073 --> 41:14.383
- Yes, sir. - Clean it up.

702
41:14.383 --> 41:15.983
Clean it up quickly.

703
41:16.043 --> 41:18.313
- Clean it up. - Oh, I am sorry too.

704
41:18.383 --> 41:19.753
Oh, what should we do?

705
41:19.813 --> 41:21.123
You are wearing such a nice suit too.

706
41:24.293 --> 41:27.293
- Goodness! - I am sorry, this safety pin...

707
41:27.363 --> 41:29.123
Oh, it is okay.

708
41:33.093 --> 41:35.303
- It is right here. - Oh, yes.

709
41:35.363 --> 41:38.073
Here too. Do not leave any behind.

710
41:40.533 --> 41:44.173
- Please be careful. It is costly. - Oh, yes.

711
41:44.443 --> 41:46.843
Over here, scrub it hard over here.

712
41:48.883 --> 41:50.913
- Scrub it hard. - Yes.

713
41:50.983 --> 41:52.483
Scrub it. That's right.

714
41:54.723 --> 41:57.353
How is it? Is there anything else you need?

715
41:57.593 --> 41:59.593
Oh, there are some stones fallen over here.

716
41:59.653 --> 42:02.623
Oh, the stones here. Gyeong Won, give it to me.

717
42:10.833 --> 42:12.203
(J&White Wedding)

718
42:23.043 --> 42:24.883
When did you volunteer to do free weddings?

719
42:24.953 --> 42:26.553
Without even telling me?

720
42:26.613 --> 42:30.053
You always nagged me about doing volunteer work. Goodness.

721
42:30.123 --> 42:31.553
What is so funny?

722
42:32.193 --> 42:33.193
What? Nothing.

723
42:34.823 --> 42:37.933
Anyway, this makes everything clear.

724
42:39.493 --> 42:42.263
It is only right that you take over management of the company.

725
42:42.333 --> 42:43.333
What?

726
42:43.403 --> 42:46.573
You always end up saving J&White whenever there is a crisis.

727
42:47.073 --> 42:49.773
At this point, we should pretty much consider it destiny, should we not?

728
42:49.843 --> 42:51.413
You seem pretty excited about this.

729
42:51.873 --> 42:54.913
- What? - Dumping the company on me...

730
42:55.513 --> 42:57.483
must make you feel relieved already.

731
42:57.813 --> 43:00.723
Oh, come on, why would you say it like that?

732
43:01.253 --> 43:02.683
Then how am I supposed to forget?

733
43:04.023 --> 43:06.323
It is easy for you to just up and leave,

734
43:07.623 --> 43:09.763
but I have to stay here.

735
43:10.493 --> 43:12.393
The entirety of J&White...

736
43:12.463 --> 43:14.403
is filled with traces of you,

737
43:15.263 --> 43:16.263
so how am I...

738
43:17.973 --> 43:19.873
supposed to erase you?

739
43:23.873 --> 43:24.873
Mi Young.

740
43:25.473 --> 43:27.013
I am not confident I can do it alone.

741
43:33.213 --> 43:35.023
I am not confident either, Mi Young.

742
43:36.083 --> 43:38.153
Honestly, I am so embarrassed to say this.

743
43:40.093 --> 43:43.193
I am actually terrified that I will ruin the company without you.

744
43:44.363 --> 43:47.863
I am so scared that I do not even dare...

745
43:49.203 --> 43:50.703
to try running the company on my own.

746
43:55.773 --> 43:57.343
But you are different from me.

747
43:58.643 --> 43:59.743
You are brave.

748
44:01.043 --> 44:02.743
You put up with a guy like me for seven years,

749
44:02.813 --> 44:04.483
so you are a truly amazing person...

750
44:05.713 --> 44:07.583
and an amazing woman.

751
44:07.653 --> 44:10.383
Even I think that is pretty amazing.

752
44:18.963 --> 44:19.963
Our child...

753
44:22.233 --> 44:24.103
You can take responsibility and raise it well, right?

754
44:30.273 --> 44:32.873
I am always shamelessly asking you for favours like this.

755
44:34.073 --> 44:35.083
I am sorry.

756
44:36.713 --> 44:37.753
Do you even know what you're sorry for?

757
44:42.653 --> 44:43.753
As long as you know, it's fine.

758
44:58.173 --> 44:59.903
(Yeonnam Family Court)

759
44:59.973 --> 45:03.203
The plaintiff accepts the defendant's proposal, correct?

760
45:07.343 --> 45:08.343
Yes.

761
45:09.643 --> 45:13.083
Defendant, is it okay to conclude the mediation like this?

762
45:16.923 --> 45:18.093
Yes.

763
45:18.153 --> 45:20.653
Then I will call the judge right away.

764
45:51.893 --> 45:54.593
Mediation has the same effect as a final judgment,

765
45:54.663 --> 45:58.093
and I confirm the mediation between both parties has been established.

766
46:04.303 --> 46:07.273
The plaintiff and defendant are divorced.

767
46:16.813 --> 46:19.353
Oh, my.

768
46:19.713 --> 46:22.623
Well, it ended like this for you two.

769
46:23.983 --> 46:25.823
Meeting like this is fate too.

770
46:25.893 --> 46:28.593
How about soft tofu stew at the place by the intersection...

771
46:28.663 --> 46:31.663
The two of us should leave.

772
46:33.063 --> 46:35.903
Oh, I suppose we should.

773
46:35.963 --> 46:36.963
Yes.

774
46:38.533 --> 46:39.533
Yes, well then.

775
46:51.013 --> 46:52.553
(Yeonnam Family Court)

776
46:57.483 --> 46:58.793
What was it this time?

777
47:02.493 --> 47:03.623
Bait and conscience.

778
47:05.033 --> 47:07.063
Which one did you use to hook them?

779
47:07.133 --> 47:09.563
Do you still think you lost?

780
47:09.633 --> 47:11.633
Then did you lose?

781
47:11.703 --> 47:12.703
No.

782
47:14.803 --> 47:17.673
But I don't feel like I won, either.

783
47:18.243 --> 47:19.643
Telepathy.

784
47:20.643 --> 47:23.113
- What? - Neither bait nor conscience...

785
47:24.713 --> 47:26.253
but telepathy.

786
47:51.313 --> 47:52.313
What?

787
48:01.983 --> 48:04.923
I really don't know what to say at a time like this.

788
48:05.993 --> 48:06.993
I know.

789
48:08.093 --> 48:10.363
It's cliche, but only one thing comes to mind.

790
48:13.633 --> 48:15.163
Take care of yourself.

791
48:15.733 --> 48:16.733
Don't get sick.

792
48:17.873 --> 48:18.873
You too, Won Ho.

793
48:21.573 --> 48:22.573
Then...

794
48:24.203 --> 48:28.443
it's cliche, but should we shake hands one last time?

795
48:37.283 --> 48:38.823
Goodbye, Ji Won Ho.

796
48:40.253 --> 48:42.693
Goodbye, Mi Young.

797
48:54.503 --> 48:58.343
(1 year later)

798
48:59.743 --> 49:03.043
- Hello. Right this way. - Okay. It's that way.

799
49:12.123 --> 49:13.123
Vice President Song.

800
49:16.463 --> 49:18.893
- Yes? - The fabric arrived.

801
49:18.963 --> 49:20.663
Oh, hold on.

802
49:21.303 --> 49:23.533
Ma'am, I'll call you back.

803
49:25.933 --> 49:28.303
- Please take a look for a moment. - Okay.

804
49:30.603 --> 49:32.273
- Welcome. - Hello.

805
49:32.343 --> 49:34.943
Is a consultation possible with the CEO today?

806
49:35.013 --> 49:36.883
Oh, the CEO?

807
49:36.943 --> 49:39.753
The CEO is out for a moment right now.

808
49:39.913 --> 49:42.683
I'm the Vice President, though.

809
49:42.983 --> 49:44.083
Vice President...

810
49:47.963 --> 49:49.993
Oh, yes, um, just a moment.

811
49:50.993 --> 49:52.363
(Baek Mi Young)

812
49:57.133 --> 49:58.403
(Song A Ri)

813
50:04.713 --> 50:06.973
Shouldn't you answer that?

814
50:07.043 --> 50:09.583
Don't worry about it and just answer my question.

815
50:09.643 --> 50:11.283
You're the one who poached my designer, right?

816
50:11.353 --> 50:13.453
Poached? No way.

817
50:13.513 --> 50:16.683
- I officially scouted them. - That's the same thing.

818
50:16.823 --> 50:18.053
Whatever.

819
50:18.523 --> 50:20.353
- Give them back right now. - Give you back what?

820
50:20.423 --> 50:23.823
Put my designer back where they belong right now.

821
50:23.993 --> 50:27.133
Do you know how much effort I put into bringing that designer in?

822
50:27.733 --> 50:30.203
I don't know exactly how much effort that was,

823
50:30.703 --> 50:33.403
but I probably added another zero to it.

824
50:33.473 --> 50:34.673
Hey, Calvin.

825
50:34.743 --> 50:37.773
Sorry, but that is water under the bridge.

826
50:38.343 --> 50:42.183
I made an official offer, and your designer accepted it.

827
50:45.313 --> 50:48.023
Come on, do not be like that. You are Calvin.

828
50:48.083 --> 50:51.393
You can find a much better designer whenever you want.

829
50:51.453 --> 50:52.753
Okay? Please.

830
51:03.333 --> 51:05.073
No, I cannot give them back.

831
51:06.573 --> 51:08.203
It is hard to find a good designer these days.

832
51:08.273 --> 51:10.373
That is why I worked so hard to bring them in.

833
51:10.443 --> 51:14.073
Help me out a little. Please? Come on.

834
51:16.583 --> 51:17.843
Get a grip.

835
51:17.913 --> 51:21.423
- No. - Oh, come on, please help me out.

836
51:21.483 --> 51:24.183
- I am having a hard time. - Then give me money.

837
51:24.253 --> 51:26.693
- You are so cheap, seriously. - You do not want to do that, right?

838
51:26.753 --> 51:27.753
Yes.

839
51:27.823 --> 51:31.463
- Hey, please. - No way.

840
51:31.533 --> 51:32.733
Goodness.

841
51:32.793 --> 51:36.503
- It was hard to hire them. - Where is this audacity from?

842
51:43.503 --> 51:45.073
Calvin, that jerk...

843
51:45.143 --> 51:46.973
How can he be so shameless?

844
51:47.043 --> 51:49.513
After all those times he bent over backward for you.

845
51:49.583 --> 51:51.783
This is why you should never trust men.

846
51:51.853 --> 51:54.953
Anyway, where are we going to find another designer?

847
51:55.023 --> 51:57.993
I know, they did not even last a month this time.

848
51:59.123 --> 52:02.223
But why do the designers keep leaving?

849
52:02.293 --> 52:04.323
What do you think the reason is?

850
52:04.393 --> 52:06.093
Why in the world could it be?

851
52:08.163 --> 52:10.203
- Well? - What?

852
52:10.263 --> 52:13.873
- Is it because of me? - Honestly, you're really picky.

853
52:13.933 --> 52:15.873
You cannot tolerate even a single mistake.

854
52:15.943 --> 52:17.143
You are an extreme perfectionist.

855
52:19.213 --> 52:20.213
Was I?

856
52:21.213 --> 52:24.243
- I cannot do things half-heartedly. - So, then...

857
52:24.783 --> 52:26.483
should I post the job opening again?

858
52:27.013 --> 52:31.723
We have to. Oh, with a higher salary this time?

859
52:31.993 --> 52:34.523
Goodness. Fine.

860
52:37.193 --> 52:38.463
- Welcome. - Welcome.

861
52:46.803 --> 52:48.143
Yes, this is Baek Mi Young.

862
52:49.343 --> 52:51.943
- Oh, yes. - I, Baek Mi Young...

863
52:53.343 --> 52:54.713
My life after divorce...

864
52:56.713 --> 52:58.483
is still tough.

865
52:58.983 --> 53:02.523
Worries and chores pile up like a mountain,

866
53:02.983 --> 53:06.923
and now I have to face all of this all by myself.

867
53:06.993 --> 53:09.163
For those of you who think you have a round face,

868
53:09.223 --> 53:10.863
it is better to leave it open.

869
53:12.263 --> 53:13.563
However, I...

870
53:13.633 --> 53:15.303
already know from experience.

871
53:17.063 --> 53:18.733
That this hardship right now...

872
53:19.303 --> 53:22.143
is just a passing season anyway.

873
53:28.213 --> 53:30.213
Is it possible to come to work in the afternoon?

874
53:30.283 --> 53:32.253
I have a hard time waking up in the morning.

875
53:32.313 --> 53:34.553
I can use my vacation days however I want, right?

876
53:34.613 --> 53:36.353
Do places like this give performance bonuses?

877
53:36.423 --> 53:38.953
I do not think this is a good fit for me.

878
53:39.023 --> 53:40.993
Is there a separate snack time?

879
53:42.193 --> 53:44.293
You have to deal with customers all day,

880
53:44.363 --> 53:45.893
and you want to be eating snacks constantly?

881
53:46.463 --> 53:47.993
(CEO Baek Mi Young)

882
53:59.873 --> 54:01.683
If I endure this winter,

883
54:02.743 --> 54:06.053
spring will surely come.

884
55:04.243 --> 55:07.343
There is nothing special today.

885
55:07.413 --> 55:09.383
Really? I think it is very interesting.

886
55:09.583 --> 55:13.513
- Stop staring. It will wear out. - No, I am going to keep looking.

887
55:13.913 --> 55:16.823
How can I never get tired of looking at your face, honey?

888
55:16.883 --> 55:18.553
Oh, what is wrong with you?

889
55:18.623 --> 55:21.763
- Stop joking around. - I am not joking. I am serious.

890
55:21.823 --> 55:23.593
Oh, you did not even put anything on your face,

891
55:23.663 --> 55:25.693
but how is it glowing like this?

892
55:26.293 --> 55:27.533
Gosh, it is blinding.

893
55:29.103 --> 55:31.833
- I did! - What?

894
55:31.903 --> 55:33.073
No, you did not.

895
55:35.543 --> 55:37.903
- Anyway, you are really pretty. - What is so funny?

896
55:39.313 --> 55:40.573
Hello.

897
55:41.073 --> 55:42.283
I see you often.

898
55:42.813 --> 55:46.613
- I saw you seven times this week. - Oh, you are right.

899
55:54.123 --> 55:55.123
Stop it.

900
56:03.663 --> 56:04.663
Goodbye.

901
56:08.643 --> 56:09.803
What is it?

902
56:09.873 --> 56:12.813
- What are you two doing right now? - Oh, it is just a thing.

903
56:14.343 --> 56:15.713
You do not need to know, Mom.

904
56:15.783 --> 56:17.743
Gosh, why do you want to know everything?

905
56:17.813 --> 56:19.183
Are you having fun?

906
56:19.613 --> 56:20.953
What's wrong?

907
56:21.013 --> 56:22.983
If you are jealous, you should date someone too.

908
56:23.053 --> 56:25.993
Gosh, dating, my foot.

909
56:26.753 --> 56:29.693
By the way, have you heard anything from Won Ho?

910
56:29.763 --> 56:31.663
Won Ho? No, I have not.

911
56:32.063 --> 56:34.533
Gosh, if Won Ho is doing well, he should say so.

912
56:34.593 --> 56:36.033
He should at least call.

913
56:36.103 --> 56:39.033
I do not even know if he is dead or alive.

914
56:39.103 --> 56:40.403
Do not worry, Mom.

915
56:40.473 --> 56:44.803
- No news is good news. - Must be nice to be carefree.

916
56:49.683 --> 56:51.613
You are saying the Azalea bloomed?

917
56:51.683 --> 56:54.453
I am telling you. And in full bloom too.

918
56:57.323 --> 56:58.323
(CEO Baek Mi Young)

919
56:58.893 --> 57:00.993
Look, I am right, aren't I?

920
57:01.053 --> 57:03.623
Oh, my. You were right.

921
57:04.023 --> 57:05.863
But the weather has not even warmed up yet,

922
57:05.933 --> 57:07.393
how did it bloom so fast?

923
57:07.463 --> 57:09.733
Exactly. It is so amazing.

924
57:10.803 --> 57:13.733
Hey, I have a good feeling about this.

925
57:14.973 --> 57:17.673
They are definitely coming today.

926
57:18.103 --> 57:20.873
- What? - The designer, I mean.

927
57:21.413 --> 57:22.413
I feel...

928
57:22.483 --> 57:25.683
a really great person is going to come today.

929
57:25.753 --> 57:26.983
I can just feel it.

930
57:27.053 --> 57:29.983
- You can just feel it? - I am telling you.

931
57:30.223 --> 57:32.993
I mean, an Azalea in this weather?

932
57:33.053 --> 57:35.563
This is totally a sign from the skies.

933
57:35.923 --> 57:37.893
We have one applicant coming in the morning, right?

934
57:37.963 --> 57:40.863
Yes, and they studied abroad.

935
57:41.393 --> 57:45.533
- The resume is very impressive. - All right.

936
57:45.833 --> 57:47.933
It is right here, so take a look.

937
57:48.003 --> 57:49.103
Okay.

938
57:49.173 --> 57:50.873
- Good luck. - Good luck.

939
57:54.043 --> 57:58.183
(CEO Baek Mi Young)

940
58:00.953 --> 58:03.353
(Wedding Dress Order Form)

941
58:48.603 --> 58:49.603
Hello.

942
59:07.253 --> 59:09.253
